{%- comment -%}
    ==== [ Info ] ====

    The payment icons displayed in your theme are determined by your store's payment settings, as well as the customer's region and currency. 
    If you want to add or remove payment icons without affecting your payment settings, edit the code below.

    Learn more: https://docs.openthinking.net/themes/etheryx/kb/payment-icons/

    /!\ Changing this file will affect all payment icons on the theme. /!\

    ==== [ dev ] ====

    Accepts:

    Usage:
    {%- render 'inc-payment-icons' -%}
{%- endcomment -%}

<ul x-flex style="gap:var(--space-1)" class="no-style inside">
    {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
        <li><i class="payments">{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'payment-icon' }}</i></li>
    {%- endfor -%}
</ul>